    "q": "What makes four wheel drive golf carts and lifted buggies suitable for acreage?",
    "a": "Ground clearance, grippy all-terrain tyres, a strong controller, four-wheel braking and suspension that keeps the wheels on the ground. True four-wheel drive is rare in golf buggies, so confirm the drivetrain of any model. Lift height alone does not make a buggy capable, so ask what else changed from the standard model."
